  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">support to NCHR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed initiative for TPP is to support communication and partnership roles and enhance awareness raising at The National Centre for Human Rights (NCHR), to further its mission, vision and extensive mandate to address a wide range of human rights issues, including violations, complaints, gender inequality, education and promoting and integrating human rights into legislations and practices, in accordance with the Jordanian Constitution and international human rights norms.</narrative>
  </description>
